### =================================================================
### API Tests for "馋了么" Backend
### 
### 说明:
### 1. 变量 (Variables) 在文件顶部定义，方便统一管理。
### 2. 每个请求块由 '###' 分隔。
### 3. 点击每个请求上方的 "Send Request" 链接来发送请求。
### 4. 响应会直接显示在 VS Code 的一个新窗口中。
### 5. `@name` 用于命名请求，方便后续引用。
### =================================================================

# --- 全局变量定义 ---
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@customer_token = 
@merchant_token = 
@rider_token = 
@new_order_id = 

#################################################################
# 阶段 1: 认证 (Authentication)
#################################################################

### (1.1) 商家注册 (专用接口)
# @name merchantRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user": {
        "username": "laoban_01",
        "password": "password_laoban_01",
        "email": "laoban01@test.com",
        "phone_number": "18800000001",
        "full_name": "店铺老板一号",
        "user_type": "restaurant_admin"
    },
    "restaurant": {
        "restaurant_name": "老板一号的深夜食堂",
        "description":"超级好吃，一定要尝尝",
        "address": "虚拟美食街101号",
        "phone_number": "010-11112222",
        "opening_hours": "18:00-02:00"
    }
}

### (1.2) 商家登录
# @name merchantLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "laoban_01",
    "password": "password_laoban_01"
}

###
# 自动捕获商家登录后的token
@merchant_token = {{merchantLogin.response.body.token}}


### (1.3) 顾客注册 (通用接口)
# @name customerRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "wuming",
    "password": "password_wuming",
    "email": "wuming@test.com",
    "phone_number": "18800000002",
    "full_name": "吴明",
    "user_type": "customer"
}

### (1.4) 顾客登录
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "wuming",
    "password": "password_wuming"
}

###
# 自动捕获顾客登录后的token
@customer_token = {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}


### (1.5) 骑手注册 (通用接口)
# @name riderRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "qishou_feimao",
    "password": "password_qishou_feimao",
    "email": "feimao@test.com",
    "phone_number": "18800000003",
    "full_name": "骑手飞毛",
    "user_type": "courier"
}

### (1.6) 骑手登录
# @name riderLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "qishou_feimao",
    "password": "password_qishou_feimao"
}

###
# 自动捕获骑手登录后的token
@rider_token = {{riderLogin.response.body.token}}


#################################################################
# 阶段 2: 核心业务流程 (The Main Loop)
#################################################################

### (2.1) [顾客] 浏览/搜索餐厅 (带搜索参数)
# 注意：你需要先在数据库中有一些餐厅和菜品数据才能搜索到
# 这里的 "王五的美味快餐" 来自你的示例SQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants?keyword=王五

### (2.2) [顾客] 查看餐厅详情
# 假设 "王五的美味快餐" 的 restaurant_id 是 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/1

### (2.3) [顾客] 下单
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "deliveryAddress": "北京市朝阳区幸福小区1号楼 (新地址)",
    "items": [
        { "itemId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
        { "itemId": 2, "quantity": 2 }
    ],
    "notes": "多放辣，谢谢！"
}

###
# 自动捕获新创建的订单ID
@new_order_id = {{createOrder.response.body.order.order_id}}


### (2.4) [商家] 查看新订单
# @name getNewOrders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/restaurant/new
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}

### (2.5) [商家] 确认接单
# @name confirmOrder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}


### (2.6) [骑手] 查看可接订单（订单广场）
# @name getAvailableOrders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/rider/available
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}


### (2.7) [骑手] 接单（抢单）
# @name acceptOrder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}